  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:340px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-orange pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Strength Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/8618359-tommy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260527224021\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"8618359-tommy\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/8618359-tommy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260527224021\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/8618359-tommy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20260527224021 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/2/2d/8618359-tommy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260527224021 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"8618359-tommy\" width=\"270\" height=\"272\" data-image-key=\"8618359-tommy.jpg\" data-image-name=\"8618359-tommy.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Twenty-Man Tommy (WildStorm Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal/absorb the strength of others and add it onto one's power level.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>steal/absorb the strength of others and add it onto one's power level</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Manipulation\" title=\"Strength Manipulation\">Strength Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Brawn Absorption/Draining/Leeching/Sapping/Stealing/Theft</li>\n<li>Strong Absorption/Draining/Leeching/Sapping/Stealing/Theft</li>\n<li>Strength Draining/Leeching/Sapping/Stealing/Theft</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal or absorb the strength/physical power of others and add it to their own to increase their physical attributes. The user can drain away the level of strength an opponent possesses and render them physically weak temporarily or permanently depending on their level of skill. The user can also absorb the physical power from attacks to render them inert.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Invulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Invulnerability\">Invulnerability</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Peak_Human_Strength\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Peak Human Strength\">Peak Human Strength</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Strength\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Strength\">Enhanced Strength</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Strength\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Strength\">Supernatural Strength</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Empowerment\" title=\"Strength Empowerment\">Strength Empowerment</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Muscle_Manipulation\" title=\"Muscle Manipulation\">Muscle Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Strength_Manipulation\" title=\"Strength Manipulation\">Strength Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May need to make physical contact with an object or individual to steal their strength.</li>\n<li>May be a limit to how much strength the user can take from another.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Strength\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Strength\">Absolute Strength</a> cannot be completely drained.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Mrrungo-Mu_(Earth-616)\">Mrrungo-Mu/Enslaver</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvel.fandom.com/wiki/Rogue_(Anna_Marie)_(Earth-616)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvel:Rogue (Anna Marie) (Earth-616)\">Ann Marie LeBeau/Rogue</a> (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://dc.fandom.com/wiki/I.C._Harris_(Filmation_Adventures)\">I.C. Harris/Parasite</a> (<i>Filmation's New Adventures of Superman</i>)</li>\n<li>Parasite (<i>DC Comics</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Kevin_Levin_(Classic)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Kevin Levin (Classic)\">Kevin Levin</a> (<i>Ben 10 series</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://ben10.fandom.com/wiki/Aggregor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ben10:Aggregor\">Aggregor</a> (<i>Ben 10: Ultimate Alien</i>)</li>\n<li>Vorahk (<i>Bionicle</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://return-of-the-crazy-demon.fandom.com/wiki/Lee_Jaha\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:return-of-the-crazy-demon:Lee Jaha\">Lee Jaha</a> (<i>Return of the Mad Demon</i>)</li>\n<li>Kazuma Satou (<i>KonoSuba: God's Blessing on This Wonderful World!</i>)</li>\n<li>Wiz (<i>KonoSuba: God's Blessing on This Wonderful World!</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li>\n<li>Twenty-Man Tommy (<i>WildStorm Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Hades (<i>Disney's Hercules</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of the Life Drain Technique (<i>Gosuverse</i>)\n<ul><li>Gha Woobok</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://oots.fandom.com/wiki/\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:oots\">Various Characters</a> (<i>The Order of the Stick</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Strength_Sap_(move)\">Strength Sap</a> (<i>Pokémon</i>)</li>\n<li>Turbo K.O. (<i>OK K.O.! Let's Be Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://ok-ko.fandom.com/wiki/Laserblast\">Laserblast/Professor Venomous</a> (<i>OK K.O.! Let's Be Heroes</i>); formerly</li>\n<li>Rupert Swaggert/Meat Sweats (<i>Rise of the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles</i>)</li>\n<li>Leech (<i>Static Shock</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FStrength_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"d222482c0328206be0203d5bf6b21317\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"h